# Which local files `clasp push` uploads to the Apps Script project.
#
# The presence of this file REPLACES clasp's built-in defaults rather than
# adding to them, so the block below is a copy of those defaults (ignore
# everything, then re-admit the file types Apps Script understands) and the
# project-specific rules follow it.
**/**
!**/appsscript.json
!**/*.gs
!**/*.js
!**/*.ts
!**/*.html
.git/**
node_modules/**

# Only the real private_values.js belongs in the Apps Script project. The
# example is a template for humans; pushing it too would put a second
# `globalThis.PRIVATE_VALUES` assignment in the same global scope, and the one
# that loaded last would win.
private_values.example.js
